{"id":"en_the-hidden-plus-sized-luna-queen","title":"The Hidden Plus-Sized Luna Queen","titleEn":"The Hidden Plus-Sized Luna Queen","description":"Lirael, the daughter of an Alpha, carries a deadly power concealed beneath a curse that makes her overweight. After her fiancé abandons her and her mother is stripped of the Luna title, she joins the Royal Guard Trials in spite of the mockery she faces. When an eclipse shatters the potion's hold, both her strength and her beauty are set free. Prince Lucian, a figure from her past, stands at her side as she reshapes the laws of the wolves. The Hidden Plus-Sized Luna Queen can be followed on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-hidden-plus-sized-luna-queen/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-hidden-plus-sized-luna-queen/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Karma Payback","Plot Twist","Underdog Rise","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dkog2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-hidden-plus-sized-luna-queen_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dkog2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-hidden-plus-sized-luna-queen_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dkog2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-hidden-plus-sized-luna-queen_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dkog2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-hidden-plus-sized-luna-queen_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Fre